# Ruta 20 (Route 20: the sea west of the Islas Escarcha, C7, contract 53), 26 x 34. The Islas Escarcha's WEST mouth (12,3) opens on a small ice islet at the NORTH (spawn `island`); the route runs SOUTH across open
# sea (two walls of rocks, rows 14 and 24, each with a swimmer watching the gap; two more swimmers on islets) to Isla Ceniza (the warp cells (12..13,33) -> `bay_e`). Wild water table + the three rods.
@map ruta_20
@size 26 34
@interior no
@area ruta_20
@bg 0
@nofollow yes                   # contract 69: the follower stays out of the ferry and the sea
@surf yes
@fill sea_o
@encounters water rate=15
  urchip 36 38 5
  urchlord 36 40 50
  gleamlet 36 39 15
  lazatee 36 38 10
  sagatee 38 40 5
  smashrimp 38 40 10
  skipgoby 36 38 5
@end
@encounters fish_old
  flopfin 5 5 100
@end
@encounters fish_good rate=128
  glidefin 22 26 40
  inkit 22 26 40
  flopfin 15 15 20
@end
@encounters fish_super
  inkit 30 36 30
  glidefin 30 36 30
  barnacub 32 36 20
  urchlord 34 38 20
@end
@spawn island 12 4 S
@spawn south 12 32 N
